  "slug": "giskard-skills",
  "name": "Giskard Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills to streamline adoption and usage of Giskard products (OSS, Hub, Guards) for testing, evaluating, and red-teaming AI agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `rag-evaluator` (Generates tailored giskard.checks evaluation suites for RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) systems), `scenario-generator` (Generates tailored giskard.checks test scenarios and suites for AI agents).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install giskard-skills@claude-community` from `Giskard-AI/giskard-skills`.",
